# MapTiler enables localized map tiles (Arabic / Hindi / Malayalam labels).
# Sign up at https://www.maptiler.com/cloud/ (free tier: 100K tile loads/month).
# Copy this file to .env.local and paste your key. Without it, the app falls back
# to standard OpenStreetMap tiles, which show mixed-script labels and do not
# respond to the language switcher.
NEXT_PUBLIC_MAPTILER_KEY=
